# Impossible arm (log 2026-07-31): the healing blob the community actually
# plays. Every arm we have fielded had ZERO healing; the meta guide spams
# fabricator-class support and NamuWiki names combat engineers (heal units
# at twice the repair bay rate, armed, 1000hp) the mid-game staple. The
# entry is inert until a producer offers it, so if the T2 factory does not
# make combat engineers this arm is techprobe+mass40 and measures that.

name legion
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,c_tank,hoverTank,c_artillery
heavies heavyTank,heavyTank,combatEngineer
max_workers 8
mass 40
reserve -1
expand 1
counter 1
